[00:00.00] 作词 : Collins Obinna Chibueze/Sean Cook/McKay Stevens
[00:00.00][by:Icy_guy]
[00:01.00] 作曲 : Collins Obinna Chibueze/Sean Cook/McKay Stevens
[00:13.14]Aye, I see dead ends
[00:13.14]哎  我看到了路的尽头
[00:16.25]But we're still goin' strong
[00:16.25]但我们依然坚强前行
[00:20.10]We been headin' down a one-way street
[00:20.10]一直以来在一条单行道上行驶
[00:22.49]But it feel like it's wrong
[00:22.49]却感觉一切似是而非
[00:26.76]Movin' like a freight train, gettin' tired of chuggin' along
[00:26.76]像货车般前行  厌倦了缓慢的行驶
[00:32.61]I've been tryna say goodbye, but I'm gon' miss you, girl, the second you gone
[00:32.61]我试图告别  但当你离去的那一刻  我会想念你
[00:39.18]Gave me your heart, gave you heartbreak (I let you down)
[00:39.18]你把心给了我  我却给了你心碎(我让你失望了)
[00:42.21]Sorry, I'm lost in this dark place (I'll fight it out)
[00:42.21]抱歉  我迷失在这片黑暗之中 (我会努力挣脱)
[00:45.31]Somehow, I'll make it to Sunday
[00:45.31]无论如何  我会坚持到周日
[00:48.34]I promise I'll be comin' back
[00:48.34]我承诺我会回来
[00:50.49]I might die on the highway
[00:50.49]我可能会在高速公路上殒命
[00:53.64]With all my regrets
[00:53.64]带着我所有的遗憾
[00:56.70]I've been drivin' for miles and miles and miles, I can't see where it ends
[00:56.70]已经开了无数英里  看不到尽头
[01:02.93]I've been tryin' to find ways
[01:02.93]我一直在找寻方式
[01:06.08]To tell you how I feel
[01:06.08]告诉你我的所思所感
[01:08.41]Yeah, but I can't tell you goodbye 'cause I know it'll hurt
[01:08.41]是的  但我无法向你告别 因为那将令人心痛
[01:12.14]If I let go of the wheel
[01:12.14]如果我就此放开方向盘
[01:15.59]Since you stop ridin' shotgun, I ain't been myself
[01:15.59]自从你不再坐在副驾驶  我就不再是我自己
[01:18.74]Goin' out lookin' for a good time, but I'm goin' through hell
[01:18.74]在外寻找快乐时光  却仿佛置身地狱
[01:21.84]Got Jesus on the hotline sayin' you need help
[01:21.84]上帝在昭示你正需要帮助
[01:24.98]Put the liquor on the shelf, tell the devil, "Farewell"
[01:24.98]把酒放回架子上  与魔鬼说再见
[01:28.88]You gave me your heart, gave you heartbreak (I let you down)
[01:28.88]你把心给了我   我却给了你心碎（我让你失望了）
[01:32.09]Sorry, I'm lost in this dark place (I'll fight it out)
[01:32.09]抱歉   我迷失在这片黑暗之中（我会努力挣脱
[01:35.22]Somehow, I'll make it to Sunday
[01:35.22]无论如何   我会坚持到周日
[01:38.21]I promise I'll be comin' back
[01:38.21]我承诺我会回来
[01:40.35]I might die on the highway
[01:40.35]我可能会在高速公路上死去
[01:43.50]With all my regrets
[01:43.50]带着我所有的遗憾
[01:46.60]I've been drivin' for miles and miles and miles, I can't see where it ends
[01:46.60]已经开了无数英里  前路却茫茫无边
[01:52.81]I've been tryin' to find ways
[01:52.81]我一直在寻找方式
[01:55.94]To tell you how I feel
[01:55.94]告诉你我的所思所想
[01:58.28]Yeah, but I can't tell you goodbye 'cause I know it'll hurt
[01:58.28]但我不能放手  因为那将令人心痛心扉
[02:01.99]If I let go of the wheel
[02:01.99]如果我就此放开方向盘
[02:05.88]And I don't want to go down this road by myself
[02:05.88]不想独自在这条路上行驶
[02:10.61]No, I don't want to be the story
[02:10.61]不   我不想成为别人
[02:14.71]That others tell
[02:14.71]口中的故事
[02:17.71]The guy who died on the highway
[02:17.71]那个在高速公路上死去的人
[02:20.91]With all his regrets
[02:20.91]带着他所有的遗憾
[02:24.01]He was drivin' for miles and miles and miles, couldn't see where it ends
[02:24.01]他开了无数英里   看不到尽头
[02:30.25]He was tryna find ways
[02:30.25]他试图找到方式
[02:33.39]To tell her how he feels
[02:33.39]告诉她他的感受
[02:36.31]But when he looked in her eyes, he could tell she was hurt
[02:36.31]但当他凝视她的双眼   他从中看出她在受伤
[02:39.49]So he let go of the wheel
[02:39.49]所以   他放开了方向盘...
